        "geology": "Kopaonik is characterized by its geological structure of rocks of different origin and age (serpentinites, granites, slates, granite, andesite, limestone). Today s form of relief Kopaonik created, over many years, the processes of erosion. Mineral resources are given the name of Kopaonik, where since ancient times digging ore. The volcanic activity and hot mineral melt caused changes in rocks due to high temperatures and heavy pressure. This is how the mining region of Kopaonik with a large number of mines where you can find metal ores of iron, lead and zinc, as well as rare metals silver and gold and rare minerals wollastonite, fluorite and asbestos",
